s://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Blaster_Rifles"}," are most common. Docking Guns count as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"}," once installed (regardless of their original weapon category). They draw power from the ship, operating as long as the ship has power, instead of requiring ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Packs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Packs"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The cost of a Docking Gun is for the mount only- the gun itself is bought normally. Docking Guns have no effect on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"}," combat.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
